#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:829
#~ msgid ""
#~ "US-style open play — courts labelled by level, players choosing their own "
#~ "— does somewhat better: matches only form within the stronger or the "
#~ "weaker half of the club, so the skill gaps inside a match shrink. The "
#~ "simulation also models the format's social habits — about half of badly "
#~ "beaten teams run one revenge match, and close foursomes often stay on for "
#~ "another game; both mean replaying a match, and the games people choose to "
#~ "replay are usually the wrong ones. It nets out at 50% quality and 64% "
#~ "blowouts here, against the baseline's 46% and 68% — real, but a long way "
#~ "from matchmaking by rating, where Competitive+ reaches 66% and 35% in the "
#~ "same club. One caution for anyone submitting rated DUPR matches from such "
#~ "sessions: repeats and self-sorted courts carry little rating information, "
#~ "so they converge ratings poorly — the simulated ladder ends up more than "
#~ "two places off, against about one and a half for every other format."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "美式自由開放打法——場地依程度標示、球員自行選擇——表現稍好：比賽只在球會中較"
#~ "強或較弱的一半內形成，因此單場內的程度差距縮小。模擬也納入了這種形式的社交"
#~ "習慣——約半數慘敗的隊伍會再打一場復仇賽，而勢均力敵的四人組常會續留再打一"
#~ "場；兩者都意味著重複同一場對戰，而人們選擇重打的通常都是不該重打的那些。最"
#~ "終結果為品質 50%、一面倒比賽 64%，相較基準的 46% 與 68%——確有改善，但距離"
#~ "依評分配對仍差得遠：在同一球會中 Competitive+ 可達 66% 與 35%。若你打算將"
#~ "這類場次的比賽提交為 DUPR 計分賽，需注意：重複對戰與自行分組的場地所含的評"
#~ "分資訊很少，因此評分收斂很差——模擬中的排名最終偏離超過兩個名次，而其他所有"
#~ "形式約為一個半。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:983
#~ msgid ""
